      "writtenOn": "2026-01-09T14:51:00Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I get your point, but I fear that we might again be stuck for quite some time.\n\nThis change will not affect all plugins, only the ones actually having external dependencies have to be adapted. Further, there is no breaking change at runtime, i.e. as long as the plugin doesn\u0027t change, users will be able to just continue to use the already available plugin artifacts. And we are doing it on the master branch. If we submit this not directly before initiating a release, there should be time for plugin maintainers to adapt the plugins.\n\nBut let me at least split this change, to provide the option.",
      "parentUuid": "14fbfe21_1387a4a3",
      "revId": "ff62ab90fe09386ac5db9dd1d0b5d4fcffd975fb",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
